  "instructions": [
    "Sous-vide the shrimp at 130 degrees Fahrenheit for 10 minutes.",
    "Heat the sesame oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped scallions and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the wok or skillet and stir-fry for 2 minutes.",
    "Push the rice mixture to one side of the wok or skillet.",
    "Add a little more sesame oil to the other side of the wok or skillet and scramble the egg.",
